        ],
        "speaking": "Role-play meeting another adult learner at a language café. Begin with Bonjour and Je m’appelle plus your name. Ask Comment vous appelez-vous ?; respond to Ça va ?; say Enchanté(e) and close with Merci, bonne journée ! and Au revoir. Your partner uses polite vous, repeats an unclear word, and explains unfamiliar words in English if asked. Then repeat bonjour and je m’appelle aloud, noticing /ʒ/, /u/, and nasal /ɔ̃/."
